  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of administration leaders and staff from social sector in particularly Moscow city, Moscow oblast, Krasnodar and Oriol in order to improve the social and health care services of the elderly. Emphasis also on care for people suffering from dementia.</narrative>
